  "rationale": "Exfiltration requires admin_db or admin_fileserver. Both depend on a foothold gained through auth_db or auth_fileserver, and both of those need stolen_dbadmin. The only source of stolen_dbadmin is dump_dbadmin_dc, which needs admin_dc. admin_dc comes only from escalate_dc, which needs foothold_dc. foothold_dc comes only from auth_dc, which requires NOT mfa_admin. The deployed mfa:admin defence makes mfa_admin true, so auth_dc is blocked and the whole chain fails. The attacker can still gain footholds, reach the internal network, compromise the appserver and steal admin credentials, but cannot reach exfiltrated."
